# Omni (actions/actions_omni.iface.kbd)
**omni + omni**     -- Cancel (esc)
**omni + spc**      -- Space (spc)
**omni + bcsp**     -- Delete (del)
**omni + b**        -- Page Up (pgup)
**omni + c**        -- Copy (C-c)
**omni + lsft + c** -- Copy Path (C-S-c)
**omni + rsft + c** -- Copy Path (C-S-c)
**omni + f**        -- Page Down (pgdn)
**omni + h**        -- Nav Left (left)
**omni + j**        -- Nav Down (down)
**omni + k**        -- Nav Up (up)
**omni + l**        -- Nav Right (right)
**omni + m**        -- Clipboard History (M-v)
**omni + o**        -- Nav Next (right)
**omni + p**        -- Nav Prev (left)
**omni + q**        -- Window Close (A-f4)
**omni + t**        -- Tab New (C-t)
**omni + lsft + t** -- Tab Undo Close (C-S-t)
**omni + v**        -- Paste (C-v)
**omni + w**        -- Tab Close (C-w)
**omni + x**        -- Cut (C-x)
**omni + z**        -- Undo (C-z)
**omni + lsft + z** -- Redo (C-S-z)
**omni + 0**        -- Tab Goto 0 (C-0)
**omni + 1**        -- Tab Goto 1 (C-1)
**omni + 2**        -- Tab Goto 2 (C-2)
**omni + 3**        -- Tab Goto 3 (C-3)
**omni + 4**        -- Tab Goto 4 (C-4)
**omni + 5**        -- Tab Goto 5 (C-5)
**omni + 6**        -- Tab Goto 6 (C-6)
**omni + 7**        -- Tab Goto 7 (C-7)
**omni + 8**        -- Tab Goto 8 (C-8)
**omni + 9**        -- Tab Goto 9 (C-9)
**omni + !lmet**    -- Desktops Toggle
**omni + ralt**     -- Apps Toggle (M-tab)
